# game/ch15.rpy:34
translate english ch15_2e5f3dd0:

    # n "期末考试结束的周六，阳光正好。这也是阿狐成为「反诈小卫士」整整一周年的日子。"
    n "The Saturday after final exams, with the sun shining bright. It was also exactly one year to the day since Ahu became the \"Anti-Fraud Guardian\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:35
translate english ch15_1a5850dc:

    # n "这一年，他实打实经历了一连串交锋：识破过假客服的「免费皮肤」，拆穿过盗号冒充小兔的借钱骗局，挂断过冒充公检法的诈骗电话，还拦下过假「爸爸」的视频求助。"
    n "Over the past year he had fought through a string of real battles: seen through a fake support agent's \"free skins\", exposed a hacker impersonating Xiaotu to borrow money, hung up on fake-police scam calls, and stopped a phony \"Dad\" video plea."

# game/ch15.rpy:36
translate english ch15_c0209943:

    # n "老师请他在班会上分享反诈经验，同学们都叫他「反诈小卫士」。时间一长，阿狐心里悄悄冒出一个念头——"
    n "The teacher had him share anti-fraud tips at class meetings, and his classmates all called him the \"Anti-Fraud Guardian\". Over time, a thought quietly sprouted in Ahu's mind —"

# game/ch15.rpy:37
translate english ch15_4d007c55:

    # think laugh "什么骗局我没见过？现在的骗子再来，我一眼就能看穿！"
    think laugh "What scam haven't I seen? If a scammer comes now, I'll see through them at a glance!"

# game/ch15.rpy:38
translate english ch15_f2fed8c8:

    # n "早饭桌上，妈妈像往常一样，随口考了他一个问题。"
    n "At breakfast, Mom, as usual, casually tested him with a question."

# game/ch15.rpy:39
translate english ch15_dc62dc32:

    # mom laugh "儿子，咱家的暗号是什么呀？"
    mom laugh "Son, what's our family code word?"

# game/ch15.rpy:40
translate english ch15_4c9d461a:

    # mc laugh "「胡萝卜炖狐狸」！妈，这你都问了三百遍了。"
    mc laugh "\"Carrot-stewed fox\"! Mom, you've asked that three hundred times."

# game/ch15.rpy:41
translate english ch15_2ba09494:

    # dad serious "问三百遍，才能在第三百零一遍派上用场。暗号这东西，平时越像玩笑，用上的时候越救命。"
    dad serious "Asking three hundred times is what makes it work on the three hundred and first. A code word may seem like a joke every day — but the day you need it, it saves your life."

# game/ch15.rpy:42
translate english ch15_576a45c7:

    # n "阿狐嬉皮笑脸地应了。他还不知道，这句玩笑话，今天就要真的救命。"
    n "Ahu grinned and agreed. He had no idea that this little joke would save his life today."

# game/ch15.rpy:43
translate english ch15_26512319:

    # n "上午十点，阿狐刚坐到书桌前，小兔的消息先跳了出来。"
    n "At ten in the morning, Ahu had barely sat down at his desk when Xiaotu's message popped up first."

# game/ch15.rpy:44
translate english ch15_a52a493c:

    # rabbit laugh "阿狐！游戏周年庆今天是最后一天，群里都在喊领限定礼包，你领了没呀？"
    rabbit laugh "Ahu! Today's the last day of the game's anniversary — everyone in the group is shouting about the limited gift pack. Have you claimed yours yet?"

# game/ch15.rpy:45
translate english ch15_a69cc780:

    # mc laugh "来路不明的链接我可不碰。周年庆而已，错过就错过。"
    mc laugh "I don't touch links from unknown sources. It's just an anniversary event — missing it is no big deal."

# game/ch15.rpy:46
translate english ch15_9f9fc3cb:

    # rabbit laugh "就知道你会这么说，那我先去逛逛啦！"
    rabbit laugh "Knew you'd say that. I'm off to browse then!"

# game/ch15.rpy:47
translate english ch15_882d9dd4:

    # n "小兔下线了。阿狐还不知道，一场为他「量身定做」的连环骗局已经悄悄开场——对方手里，甚至捏着一份他的「档案」。"
    n "Xiaotu went offline. Ahu had no idea that a chain of scams custom-tailored for him had quietly begun — the other side even held a \"dossier\" on him."

# game/ch15.rpy:48
translate english ch15_5429993e:

    # n "上午十点整，两条消息同时弹出。终极试炼，开始了。"
    n "At ten sharp, two notifications arrived at the same time. The final trial had begun."

# game/ch15.rpy:52
translate english ch15_82c5f363:

    # n "第一条消息来自游戏群，昵称「周年庆福利官」的人喊得火热。"
    n "The first message came from the game group, where someone nicknamed \"Anniversary Benefits Officer\" was shouting up a storm."

# game/ch15.rpy:53
translate english ch15_7c5ef9c0:

    # fraud laugh "游戏周年庆最后一天！点击链接领取限定礼包+888点券，未成年玩家专属，过期清零！"
    fraud laugh "Last day of the game's anniversary! Tap the link for a limited gift pack + 888 vouchers — exclusive to underage players, gone when the day ends!"

# game/ch15.rpy:54
translate english ch15_a0e76afd:

    # n "第二条，是一个陌生账号的加好友申请——头像、昵称和真班主任一模一样，自称「王老师」。"
    n "The second was a friend request from a stranger — same avatar, same nickname as his real head teacher, calling itself \"Mr. Wang\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:55
translate english ch15_d71831fe:

    # l15_teacher serious "阿狐同学，我是王老师。这次期末你进步很大，考进了班级第9名，老师都记着呢。"
    l15_teacher serious "Ahu, this is Mr. Wang. You made big progress on the finals — ninth in the class. Teacher remembers."

# game/ch15.rpy:56
translate english ch15_dacd4903:

    # think confused "咦？连我考第9都知道……看来真是王老师本人？"
    think confused "Huh? He even knows I ranked ninth... So it really is Mr. Wang?"

# game/ch15.rpy:57
translate english ch15_3c4826d5:

    # l15_teacher serious "是这样，学校临时通知收取200元复习资料费，今天下午5点前截止。你直接转到老师这个私人账户就行，别在群里声张——老师只单独通知了几个班干部。"
    l15_teacher serious "Here's the thing: the school suddenly announced a 200-yuan review-materials fee, due by 5 p.m. today. Just transfer it to my personal account, and keep it quiet — teacher only told a few class officers."

# game/ch15.rpy:74
translate english ch15_R1a_0f53e76d:

    # n "信息说得再准，阿狐也没有乱。他心里只有一条铁律：核实，只用自己掌握的渠道。"
    n "However accurate the information, Ahu stayed steady. He held to one iron rule: verification only through channels he controls."

# game/ch15.rpy:75
translate english ch15_R1a_d5ff8d5e:

    # think serious "我的班级、名次，班级群截图和学校公示里都有——个人信息早就不是秘密。骗子知道得越多，只能说明剧本准备得越足。"
    think serious "My class and rank are right there in group screenshots and school notices — personal info was never a secret. The more the scammer knows, the more rehearsed his script is."

# game/ch15.rpy:76
translate english ch15_R1a_16ae97df:

    # mc serious "王老师，收费是大事，我需要先和妈妈确认一下。"
    mc serious "Mr. Wang, a fee is a big deal. I need to confirm with my mom first."

# game/ch15.rpy:77
translate english ch15_R1a_fc96a07a:

    # l15_teacher serious "都这么大了，这点小事还要问妈妈？5点就截止了，你一拖，全班资料都要耽误！"
    l15_teacher serious "You're this old and you still need to ask your mom about such a little thing? The deadline is 5 p.m. — if you drag it out, the whole class misses their materials!"

# game/ch15.rpy:78
translate english ch15_R1a_afec2eed:

    # n "阿狐不再回复，翻出通讯录里存的真班主任号码，直接拨了过去。"
    n "Ahu stopped replying, found the real head teacher's number saved in his contacts, and dialed it directly."

# game/ch15.rpy:79
translate english ch15_R1a_7f7778e7:

    # n "电话响了很久，一直无人接听——周六，老师八成在忙。"
    n "The phone rang and rang, but no one picked up — it was Saturday; the teacher was probably tied up."

# game/ch15.rpy:80
translate english ch15_R1a_27b1f482:

    # think serious "没打通，更要稳住。绝不能用「王老师」发来的任何号码回拨——那正是骗局最想让我做的事。"
    think serious "No answer means I must hold steady all the more. I must not call back on any number \"Mr. Wang\" provided — that is exactly what the scam wants me to do."

# game/ch15.rpy:81
translate english ch15_R1a_22e02943:

    # n "就在这时，一个陌生来电打了进来，自称「学校财务处」：同学你好，听说你在核实王老师收费的事？我们可以帮你查证……"
    n "Just then, a stranger called, calling itself the \"school finance office\": Hello, we hear you're checking on Mr. Wang's fee? We can help you verify..."

# game/ch15.rpy:82
translate english ch15_R1a_fe86532b:

    # think serious "等等——我还没跟任何人说我在核实，这个「财务处」怎么掐着点找上门？八成是骗子的同伙，专门蹲在「核实」这一步守株待兔！"
    think serious "Wait — I haven't told anyone I was verifying. How did this \"finance office\" call at exactly the right moment? It must be the scammer's accomplice, waiting to pounce on anyone who tries to verify!"

# game/ch15.rpy:83
translate english ch15_R1a_b12d8cc9:

    # mc serious "谢谢，不用了。核实我自己会打学校官方电话，再见。"
    mc serious "Thanks, but no. I'll verify with the school's official number myself. Goodbye."

# game/ch15.rpy:84
translate english ch15_R1a_d1e2f4de:

    # n "阿狐挂断、拉黑了全部陌生号码，又故意留下了「王老师」那个账号——证据，一条都不能少。现在，只剩等真老师回电了。"
    n "Ahu hung up and blocked every unknown number, but deliberately kept the \"Mr. Wang\" account — evidence, every single bit of it. Now all that was left was waiting for the real teacher to call back."

# game/ch15.rpy:89
translate english ch15_R1b_391c0e20:

    # n "阿狐没有转账，也没有拉黑，而是把聊天截图发进了班级群：大家有收到「王老师」的资料费通知吗？"
    n "Ahu didn't transfer, and he didn't block anyone. Instead he posted the chat screenshots in the class group: Has anyone else gotten this \"materials fee\" notice from Mr. Wang?"

# game/ch15.rpy:90
translate english ch15_R1b_abd0b66f:

    # n "不到一分钟，群里呼应四起。"
    n "In under a minute, replies came flooding in."

# game/ch15.rpy:91
translate english ch15_R1b_064804b4:

    # n "头像是班长的人说：收到了收到，我刚交完。"
    n "The account with the class monitor's avatar said: Got it, got it — I just paid mine."

# game/ch15.rpy:92
translate english ch15_R1b_fc0768ce:

    # n "头像是小兔妈妈的人说：我家孩子也交了，老师办事真高效。"
    n "The account with Xiaotu's mom's avatar said: My kid paid too. Such an efficient teacher."

# game/ch15.rpy:93
translate english ch15_R1b_9cb216a9:

    # think confused "连班长和小兔妈妈都交了……难道是我多心了？可为什么，这些呼应来得也太齐了？"
    think confused "Even the class monitor and Xiaotu's mom have paid... Was I overthinking it? But why did all these replies come in so perfectly in step?"

# game/ch15.rpy:94
translate english ch15_R1b_deec0d6b:

    # n "阿狐犹豫着没有作声。他没注意到，「班长」和「小兔妈妈」都是前几天刚注册的小号。"
    n "Ahu hesitated and stayed quiet. He didn't notice that the \"class monitor\" and \"Xiaotu's mom\" were throwaway accounts registered just days ago."

# game/ch15.rpy:95
translate english ch15_R1b_2554bf85:

    # n "真正的班长还在补习班，小兔妈妈根本不在这个群里——呼应骗局，最擅长用热闹掩盖破绽。"
    n "The real class monitor was at cram school, and Xiaotu's mom wasn't even in that group — echo scams are masters at burying flaws under a bustle of agreement."

# game/ch15.rpy:96
translate english ch15_R1b_b8b7bf72:

    # n "这时，「王老师」又发来消息，换了一副语重心长的口气。"
    n "Just then, \"Mr. Wang\" sent another message, his tone turning earnest and kind."

# game/ch15.rpy:97
translate english ch15_R1b_00616e36:

    # l15_teacher serious "阿狐，名单你都看到了，人是真的，事也是真的。这样吧，4点半前交齐，老师私下返你5元跑腿费，就当辛苦费。"
    l15_teacher serious "Ahu, you've seen the list — the people are real and the matter is real. How about this: pay by 4:30, and teacher will slip you a 5-yuan errand fee for your trouble."

# game/ch15.rpy:98
translate english ch15_R1b_9d0475a9:

    # think confused "又是名单，又是跑腿费……越是这样，我心里越不踏实。"
    think confused "A list again, plus an errand fee... The more he adds, the less settled I feel."

# game/ch15.rpy:103
translate english ch15_R1c_8e04ee8a:

    # n "阿狐先点了「礼包链接」。页面做得和官网一模一样，他熟练地填上了游戏账号和密码。"
    n "Ahu tapped the \"gift pack link\" first. The page was a dead ringer for the official site, and he smoothly entered his game account and password."

# game/ch15.rpy:104
translate english ch15_R1c_b45038b8:

    # n "最后一步，页面弹出提示：请输入刚收到的短信验证码，完成安全校验。他想都没想，填了。"
    n "At the final step, the page popped up a prompt: enter the verification code just sent to your phone to complete security checks. Without a second thought, he typed it in."

# game/ch15.rpy:105
translate english ch15_R1c_d47ce3b0:

    # n "接着，他又给「王老师」转了200元资料费。"
    n "Then he transferred the 200-yuan materials fee to \"Mr. Wang\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:106
translate english ch15_R1c_2306f605:

    # think laugh "名次被老师夸，礼包到手，资料费交齐——今天双喜临门！"
    think laugh "Praised by the teacher for my rank, the gift pack claimed, the fee paid — a double-red-letter day!"

# game/ch15.rpy:107
translate english ch15_R1c_f85ec5a6:

    # n "他没能注意到，那个「礼包页面」在提交之后，正把他的账号、密码和验证码，一样一样打包发往远方。"
    n "He failed to notice that after submission, that \"gift pack page\" was packing up his account, password, and verification code, piece by piece, and sending them far away."

# game/ch15.rpy:108
translate english ch15_R1c_9bfb97c5:

    # n "正得意间，「王老师」那边又有了新动作。"
    n "In the middle of his gloating, \"Mr. Wang\" made his next move."

# game/ch15.rpy:115
translate english ch15_R2_ff895f7c:

    # n "临近中午，「王老师」忽然发来视频通话请求——他要「当面」把事情说清楚。"
    n "Around noon, \"Mr. Wang\" suddenly sent a video call request — he wanted to \"explain things face to face\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:116
translate english ch15_R2_991a9b8a:

    # n "阿狐按下了接听键。是真是假，他要亲眼看一看。"
    n "Ahu pressed answer. Real or fake, he wanted to see it with his own eyes."

# game/ch15.rpy:117
translate english ch15_R2_bc119e58:

    # n "熟悉的眼镜，熟悉的发型，连背后办公室的窗帘都和真的一模一样。"
    n "The familiar glasses, the familiar hairstyle — even the office curtains behind him matched the real thing perfectly."

# game/ch15.rpy:118
translate english ch15_R2_f346a408:

    # l15_teacher serious "阿狐，看清了吧？老师本人，假不了。费用的事电话里说不清，今天下午4点半前必须交齐，别再拖了。"
    l15_teacher serious "See for yourself, Ahu? It's your teacher, in person. This fee business is hard to explain by phone; it must be settled by 4:30 this afternoon. Stop stalling."

# game/ch15.rpy:119
translate english ch15_R2_aaab2427:

    # n "视频只持续了十几秒，对方就匆匆挂断。阿狐盯着暗下去的屏幕，心里说不出地别扭。"
    n "The call lasted barely ten seconds before the other side hung up in a hurry. Ahu stared at the darkened screen, feeling indescribably uneasy."

# game/ch15.rpy:120
translate english ch15_R2_37cf4fbe:

    # think confused "画面有一点点糊，声音也有一点点延迟……可那张脸，确实是王老师的脸啊。"
    think confused "The picture was a touch blurry, the sound slightly delayed... but that face — that really was Mr. Wang's face."

# game/ch15.rpy:121
translate english ch15_R2_a523974b:

    # l15_teacher serious "怎么，连老师的脸你也要怀疑？视频都跟你打了，还要老师怎么证明？4点半，最后通牒。"
    l15_teacher serious "What, you'd doubt even your teacher's face? I've already video-called you — how else should teacher prove it? 4:30. Final ultimatum."

# game/ch15.rpy:137
translate english ch15_R2a_ada00b19:

    # n "阿狐不慌不忙，回拨了一个视频过去。"
    n "Ahu, unhurried, called back with a video of his own."

# game/ch15.rpy:138
translate english ch15_R2a_3bd0d65a:

    # mc laugh "老师，费用我一定重视。不过先聊聊别的——上次班会上，您当着全班表扬的是谁、批评的又是谁呀？我这块儿记性不太好。"
    mc laugh "Mr. Wang, I take the fee seriously. But let's chat about something else first — at our last class meeting, who did you praise in front of everyone, and who did you call out? My memory's a bit hazy there."

# game/ch15.rpy:139
translate english ch15_R2a_16af3990:

    # n "屏幕那头沉默了两秒。"
    n "The other end of the screen went silent for two seconds."

# game/ch15.rpy:140
translate english ch15_R2a_d76912a8:

    # l15_teacher serious "都过去的事了，提它干什么？费用要紧，你先交钱！"
    l15_teacher serious "That's all ancient history — why bring it up? The fee is what matters. Pay first!"

# game/ch15.rpy:141
translate english ch15_R2a_9e6362f9:

    # mc serious "那再简单点：您办公室窗台上那盆绿萝，是您自己买的，还是别人送的？"
    mc serious "Then something simpler: that pot of pothos ivy on your office windowsill — did you buy it yourself, or did someone give it to you?"

# game/ch15.rpy:142
translate english ch15_R2a_69061e5f:

    # n "「王老师」的脸僵了一下，视频「咔」地断了，再打过去就是「对方已取消」。"
    n "\"Mr. Wang's\" face froze. The video cut off with a click, and the next call was met with \"the other party has cancelled\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:143
translate english ch15_R2a_b623a349:

    # n "阿狐立刻再次拨打通讯录里的真班主任号码——这一次，接通了。"
    n "Ahu immediately dialed the real head teacher's number in his contacts again — this time, it went through."

# game/ch15.rpy:144
translate english ch15_R2a_716fa243:

    # n "真王老师说：学校根本没有收费，她的账号前几天刚被盗过，已经有外班同学上了当！"
    n "The real Mr. Wang said: the school wasn't collecting any fees, her account had been stolen just days ago, and students from another class had already fallen for it!"

# game/ch15.rpy:145
translate english ch15_R2a_1fe78830:

    # mc serious "老师，那个骗子还在用您的头像骗人！我这边留好了全部证据，这就发给您。"
    mc serious "Teacher, that scammer is still using your avatar to trick people! I've kept all the evidence on my end — sending it to you right now."

# game/ch15.rpy:147
translate english ch15_R2a_d7317dd4:

    # think serious "真老师随口就能答上的事，假老师一句都接不住。脸上的皮可以换，装在脑子里的记忆换不掉。"
    think serious "Things the real teacher could answer offhand, the fake couldn't catch a single one. The skin on a face can be swapped; the memories stored in a brain cannot."

# game/ch15.rpy:148
translate english ch15_R2a_58199216:

    # n "看来，视频这条路被骗子堵死了。下午一点半，一通陌生来电打了进来。"
    n "The video route was now sealed off for good. At one-thirty in the afternoon, a strange call came in."

# game/ch15.rpy:153
translate english ch15_R2b_fb56a977:

    # mc serious "老师，费用不是小事，容我考虑一下，4点半前一定答复您。"
    mc serious "Mr. Wang, a fee is no small matter. Let me think it over — I'll give you my answer by 4:30 for sure."

# game/ch15.rpy:154
translate english ch15_R2b_7d7351b9:

    # l15_teacher serious "行，我等你。不过老师把话说在前头——财务处4点半统一上报，到时候没交的，名字会直接报到德育处去。"
    l15_teacher serious "Fine, I'll wait. But let me say this up front: the finance office reports everything at 4:30. Anyone who hasn't paid goes straight to the Moral Education Office."

# game/ch15.rpy:155
translate english ch15_R2b_1bb55681:

    # n "紧接着，对方又甩来一张「未交费名单」，阿狐的名字被红笔圈了出来，后面跟着一行刺眼的小字：逾期不交，记录在案。"
    n "Right after, he fired over an \"unpaid list\" with Ahu's name circled in red, followed by a line of glaring small print: overdue, on the record."

# game/ch15.rpy:156
translate english ch15_R2b_163f6e11:

    # think worried "红圈、名单、德育处……招招都打在学生最怕的地方。可越是这样，越说明他在赌我怕，而不是他有理。"
    think worried "Red circles, lists, the Moral Education Office... every strike lands where students fear most. But that only proves he's betting on my fear, not that he's in the right."

# game/ch15.rpy:157
translate english ch15_R2b_d8873b96:

    # n "阿狐把手机扣在桌上，努力让心里那杆秤稳住。他知道，拖，只能拖一时——骗局不会因为他的犹豫而停手。"
    n "Ahu set the phone face-down on the desk and steadied the scales in his heart. He knew stalling could only buy so much — the scam wouldn't pause for his hesitation."

# game/ch15.rpy:158
translate english ch15_R2b_e83231cc:

    # n "下午一点半，一通陌生来电打了进来。"
    n "At one-thirty in the afternoon, a strange call came in."

# game/ch15.rpy:163
translate english ch15_R2c_0915cf98:

    # n "「王老师」的脸、声音、办公室的窗帘，全都对得上。阿狐不再犹豫，转出了200元资料费。"
    n "\"Mr. Wang's\" face, voice, even the office curtains — everything checked out. Ahu hesitated no longer and transferred the 200-yuan materials fee."

# game/ch15.rpy:164
translate english ch15_R2c_5ac9b327:

    # think laugh "视频都打了，还能有假？这下踏实了。"
    think laugh "We've even video-called — how could it be fake? Now I can relax."

# game/ch15.rpy:165
translate english ch15_R2c_66a5d4fe:

    # l15_teacher serious "收到！对了，学校刚补发通知，还有500元试卷印刷费，一并交到我这个账户，老师给你统一登记。"
    l15_teacher serious "Received! Oh, right — the school just issued a supplementary notice: another 500-yuan exam-printing fee, paid into this same account, and teacher will register it all for you."

# game/ch15.rpy:166
translate english ch15_R2c_52f06c52:

    # mc confused "怎么交完200又是500？一学期哪来这么多临时收费？"
    mc confused "200 just paid and now another 500? How many surprise fees can one semester have?"

# game/ch15.rpy:167
translate english ch15_R2c_06b3a826:

    # n "阿狐刚起了一点疑，对方的视频通话又一次打了进来——脸还是那张脸，口气却更急了。"
    n "Just as a flicker of doubt arose, the video call came in again — same face, but a more urgent tone."

# game/ch15.rpy:168
translate english ch15_R2c_0956d26b:

    # l15_teacher serious "先交先登记！别的同学都交完了，就差你了！"
    l15_teacher serious "Pay first, get registered first! Everyone else has paid — you're the only one left!"

# game/ch15.rpy:169
translate english ch15_R2c_5cc2bf55:

    # n "下午一点半，还没等阿狐缓过神，一通陌生来电打了进来。"
    n "At one-thirty in the afternoon, before Ahu could catch his breath, a strange call came in."

# game/ch15.rpy:176
translate english ch15_R3_3d4c8f7d:

    # l15_cop serious "我是市反诈中心李警官，警号025861！你名下的游戏账号涉嫌一起洗钱案，涉案金额86000元，现在需要你配合资金清查！"
    l15_cop serious "This is Officer Li of the Municipal Anti-Fraud Center, badge number 025861! Your game account is implicated in a money-laundering case involving 86,000 yuan. You are required to cooperate with a funds inspection!"

# game/ch15.rpy:177
translate english ch15_R3_64c28b71:

    # n "不等阿狐开口，对方精准报出他的姓名、学校、班级，甚至还有他期末考试的第9名。"
    n "Before Ahu could speak, the caller rattled off his name, school, and class — even his ninth-place ranking in the finals."

# game/ch15.rpy:178
translate english ch15_R3_1aa6489e:

    # l15_cop serious "考虑到你是未成年人，可以从轻处理：下载我们反诈中心的「安全防护」APP，开启防护模式，配合完成资金清查，就能自证清白。"
    l15_cop serious "Considering you're a minor, we can go easy on you: download our Anti-Fraud Center's \"Safety Guard\" app, turn on protection mode, and cooperate with the funds inspection to clear your name."

# game/ch15.rpy:179
translate english ch15_R3_89228f34:

    # n "对方发来一个安装包，图标做得和正规反诈APP几乎一模一样，只是角上多了一个不起眼的小箭头。"
    n "The caller sent an installer whose icon looked almost identical to the real anti-fraud app — except for one inconspicuous little arrow in the corner."

# game/ch15.rpy:181
translate english ch15_R3_acb94889:

    # think worried "老师刚确认过学校没收费，转眼「反诈中心」就找上门——果然是同一伙人在换剧本！不过这一次，钩子下得更狠了。"
    think worried "Teacher just confirmed the school collects no fees, and in a blink an \"Anti-Fraud Center\" comes knocking — same crew, new script! Only this time, the hook is set even deeper."

# game/ch15.rpy:183
translate english ch15_R3_8122fc53:

    # think worried "洗钱？我一个月零花钱才50块……可他连我考第9都知道，会不会真有人盗用我的账号干了坏事？"
    think worried "Money laundering? My allowance is 50 yuan a month... But he even knows I ranked ninth — could someone really have stolen my account and done something bad?"

# game/ch15.rpy:202
translate english ch15_R3a_78b977cb:

    # n "阿狐心里那杆秤，稳稳地落了下来。"
    n "The scales in Ahu's heart settled, steady and sure."

# game/ch15.rpy:203
translate english ch15_R3a_1bf56afb:

    # think serious "真警察办案会出示证件、走正式程序，绝不会在电话里让人装APP「自证清白」。这一套，和之前挂断过的冒充公检法，是同一个配方。"
    think serious "Real police show their credentials and follow official procedures; they never have you install an app to \"prove your innocence\" over the phone. This is the same recipe as the fake-police calls I've hung up on before."

# game/ch15.rpy:204
translate english ch15_R3a_3656df7a:

    # mc serious "李警官，如果真有案子，请通过学校或我的父母正式联系我。再见。"
    mc serious "Officer Li, if there really is a case, contact me properly through my school or my parents. Goodbye."

# game/ch15.rpy:205
translate english ch15_R3a_3ffd8956:

    # n "他挂断电话，用自己存的号码拨了110。值班民警明确答复：反诈中心从未来电要求下载APP，这是典型的冒充公检法骗局，随后帮他做了来电标记。"
    n "He hung up and dialed 110 on his own saved number. The officer on duty made it clear: the Anti-Fraud Center never calls asking people to download apps — this was a classic fake-police scam — and then flagged the number for him."

# game/ch15.rpy:206
translate english ch15_R3a_e236d1c2:

    # n "民警还提醒：近期恰有骗子冒充老师收取「资料费」，让阿狐留意班级群通知，别向任何私人账户转账。"
    n "The officer added a reminder: scammers have lately been impersonating teachers to collect \"fees\" — keep an eye on the class group notices, and never transfer to any personal account."

# game/ch15.rpy:207
translate english ch15_R3a_e8c8fe67:

    # n "阿狐顺手把这件事讲给了妈妈听。电话那头，妈妈叮嘱他：不管发生什么，先挂断，再核实。"
    n "Ahu told his mom about it as well. On the other end, Mom's instruction: whatever happens, hang up first, then verify."

# game/ch15.rpy:208
translate english ch15_R3a_793b1ed4:

    # n "可骗局的接力棒，并不会因为一次挂断而落地。傍晚四点整，最后的时刻到了。"
    n "But the scam's baton doesn't drop just because one call was cut. At four sharp, the final moment arrived."

# game/ch15.rpy:213
translate english ch15_R3b_0db3a4ea:

    # mc serious "APP我不装。但……你说账号涉案，总得让我听明白吧？"
    mc serious "I won't install the app. But... you say my account is involved — at least let me understand what this is about?"

# game/ch15.rpy:214
translate english ch15_R3b_658d95fb:

    # l15_cop serious "明白？哪有时间让你明白！资金清查两小时内必须完成，你现在把手头的事都放下，专心配合我，不许挂电话，不许告诉任何人——包括你父母，否则以泄密论处！"
    l15_cop serious "Understand? There's no time to make you understand! The funds inspection must be done within two hours. Put everything down right now and focus on cooperating with me. No hanging up, no telling anyone — including your parents — or you'll be charged with leaking the investigation!"

# game/ch15.rpy:215
translate english ch15_R3b_cbf6b28f:

    # n "这一听，就听到了傍晚。对方的每个问题都在拖时间：查银行卡、查支付账户、查游戏流水……"
    n "That \"listening\" lasted until evening. Every question the caller asked was a way to burn time: checking bank cards, checking payment accounts, checking game transaction records..."

# game/ch15.rpy:216
translate english ch15_R3b_cfbd300e:

    # n "阿狐没有意识到，这正是骗局里的「隔离」一环：只要他还在线上，就没人来得及提醒他；只要他不挂电话，恐惧就会在耳朵里一点点发酵。"
    n "Ahu didn't realize this was the \"isolation\" stage of the scam: as long as he stayed on the line, no one could reach him in time; as long as he didn't hang up, the fear would keep fermenting in his ears."

# game/ch15.rpy:217
translate english ch15_R3b_ce75b767:

    # think worried "我的耳朵怎么有点发热？他说的话，怎么越听越像真的了……"
    think worried "Why are my ears getting hot? Why do his words sound more and more believable..."

# game/ch15.rpy:218
translate english ch15_R3b_b93fa35e:

    # n "傍晚，「李警官」的语气愈发逼紧。最后的时刻到了。"
    n "As evening fell, \"Officer Li's\" tone tightened more and more. The final moment had arrived."

# game/ch15.rpy:223
translate english ch15_R3c_6080d32a:

    # n "阿狐按下了安装键。「安全防护」APP顺利启动，灰色的「防护模式」图标亮了起来。"
    n "Ahu pressed Install. The \"Safety Guard\" app started up smoothly, and the grey \"Protection Mode\" icon lit up."

# game/ch15.rpy:224
translate english ch15_R3c_77b498ad:

    # l15_cop serious "很好。现在开启屏幕共享，我们的系统要实时核验你的账户资金流向。记住，全程不许挂断。"
    l15_cop serious "Very good. Now enable screen sharing — our system needs to verify the flow of funds in your accounts in real time. Remember: do not hang up at any point."

# game/ch15.rpy:225
translate english ch15_R3c_e89e502d:

    # n "阿狐照做了。从这一刻起，他手机上的每一个字——每一条短信、每一次弹窗、每一笔余额——都同步摊在了骗子眼前。"
    n "Ahu did as told. From that moment, every word on his phone — every text, every popup, every balance — lay spread out before the scammer's eyes."

# game/ch15.rpy:226
translate english ch15_R3c_a8165923:

    # l15_cop serious "配合得不错。清查马上进入最后一步，稍后会有几条「验证短信」发到你手机上，那都是我们系统的检测码，收到后报给我登记即可。"
    l15_cop serious "Good cooperation. The inspection is about to enter its final step: shortly you'll receive a few \"verification texts\" on your phone. Those are our system's test codes — report them to me for registration as they arrive."

# game/ch15.rpy:227
translate english ch15_R3c_986a7fe3:

    # think worried "检测码？为什么我的心脏，跳得这么快……"
    think worried "Test codes? Then why is my heart pounding so fast..."

# game/ch15.rpy:228
translate english ch15_R3c_b60c63e4:

    # n "傍晚四点整，收网，开始了。"
    n "At four sharp, the net began to close."

# game/ch15.rpy:233
translate english ch15_R3c2_a42327ed:

    # n "阿狐自信满满：骗局我已经看穿，装个假APP怕什么？正好把它们的一举一动都留作证据。"
    n "Ahu was brimming with confidence: I've already seen through the scam — what's a fake app? The perfect chance to keep every move they make as evidence."

# game/ch15.rpy:234
translate english ch15_R3c2_8776d82f:

    # mc laugh "好，我配合。"
    mc laugh "Fine, I'll cooperate."

# game/ch15.rpy:235
translate english ch15_R3c2_7f3a664c:

    # n "「安全防护」APP顺利启动，灰色的「防护模式」图标亮了起来。"
    n "The \"Safety Guard\" app started up smoothly, and the grey \"Protection Mode\" icon lit up."

# game/ch15.rpy:236
translate english ch15_R3c2_77b498ad:

    # l15_cop serious "很好。现在开启屏幕共享，我们的系统要实时核验你的账户资金流向。记住，全程不许挂断。"
    l15_cop serious "Very good. Now enable screen sharing — our system needs to verify the flow of funds in your accounts in real time. Remember: do not hang up at any point."

# game/ch15.rpy:237
translate english ch15_R3c2_e89e502d:

    # n "阿狐照做了。从这一刻起，他手机上的每一个字——每一条短信、每一次弹窗、每一笔余额——都同步摊在了骗子眼前。"
    n "Ahu did as told. From that moment, every word on his phone — every text, every popup, every balance — lay spread out before the scammer's eyes."

# game/ch15.rpy:238
translate english ch15_R3c2_3c63bb82:

    # n "他原以为主动权在自己手里。可屏幕一亮起来他就发现：对方知道得太多、节奏抓得太死，每一个「要求」都容不得他细想——取证，渐渐变成了配合。"
    n "He had assumed the initiative was his. But the moment the screen lit up, he realized: they knew too much and controlled the tempo too tightly — every \"request\" left him no room to think. Gathering evidence was quietly turning into cooperating."

# game/ch15.rpy:239
translate english ch15_R3c2_01115c78:

    # think worried "不对……我到底是在钓鱼，还是已经被鱼咬住了？"
    think worried "Wait... am I the one fishing, or have I already been caught by the fish?"

# game/ch15.rpy:240
translate english ch15_R3c2_b60c63e4:

    # n "傍晚四点整，收网，开始了。"
    n "At four sharp, the net began to close."

# game/ch15.rpy:247
translate english ch15_R4_16a5b05a:

    # n "三路骗局同时发力。"
    n "All three lines of the scam struck at once."

# game/ch15.rpy:248
translate english ch15_R4_67cdf740:

    # n "钓鱼页面率先弹出：检测到账户异常，请输入短信验证码，保护你的点券资产。"
    n "The phishing page moved first: account anomaly detected — enter the SMS verification code to protect your vouchers."

# game/ch15.rpy:249
translate english ch15_R4_0c0a4ddb:

    # n "「李警官」的电话里传来一声声倒计时：清查窗口马上关闭，5、4、3……"
    n "In \"Officer Li's\" call, a countdown ticked away: the inspection window is closing — 5, 4, 3..."

# game/ch15.rpy:250
translate english ch15_R4_ce15471f:

    # n "就在这时，「妈妈」的QQ语音打了进来——声音、语气，连咳嗽的节奏都和妈妈一模一样。"
    n "At that very moment, \"Mom's\" QQ voice message came in — her voice, her tone, even the rhythm of her cough, exactly like Mom."

# game/ch15.rpy:251
translate english ch15_R4_0c403c04:

    # mom serious "儿子，别怕，是妈妈。警察叔叔已经跟妈妈说清楚了，是虚惊一场。你把手机收到的验证码报给叔叔，让他赶紧结案，别耽误咱们家。"
    mom serious "Don't be scared, sweetie, it's Mom. The police officer has already explained everything to me — it was a false alarm. Read the verification code on your phone to the officer so he can close the case quickly. Don't keep our family waiting."

# game/ch15.rpy:252
translate english ch15_R4_3b722a45:

    # think worried "妈妈今天和爸爸一起在外面办事……可这个声音，确实分毫不差。"
    think worried "Mom is out with Dad today... but that voice — it's flawless, down to the last note."

# game/ch15.rpy:253
translate english ch15_R4_846d6298:

    # l15_cop serious "听见没有？你妈妈都配合了，你还犹豫什么？"
    l15_cop serious "Hear that? Even your mother is cooperating. What are you still hesitating for?"

# game/ch15.rpy:268
translate english ch15_R4a_7ccbe2d9:

    # n "盯着三路同时发难的屏幕，阿狐深吸一口气，做了这一年学到的最重要的动作——全部停下来。"
    n "Staring at the screen where three attacks had struck at once, Ahu took a deep breath and did the most important thing he'd learned all year — stop everything."

# game/ch15.rpy:269
translate english ch15_R4a_5af5d3bf:

    # think serious "真警察不会电话办案；真妈妈不会在QQ上让我报验证码；领礼包更不需要验证码。三条线同时催我交东西——这不是巧合，是排练好的连环局！"
    think serious "Real police don't handle cases by phone; real moms don't ask me for verification codes on QQ; claiming a gift pack never needs a code. Three lines all urging me to hand something over at once — that's no coincidence, it's a rehearsed chain scam!"

# game/ch15.rpy:270
translate english ch15_R4a_cdf4874b:

    # n "他没有回复任何一条来路不明的消息，而是拨通了妈妈的真实手机号，接通后先对了一遍家庭暗号。"
    n "He didn't reply to a single message of unknown origin. Instead he dialed Mom's real cell number, and the moment she picked up, he checked the family code word first."

# game/ch15.rpy:271
translate english ch15_R4a_a83c07c7:

    # mc serious "妈，咱家的暗号是什么？"
    mc serious "Mom, what's our family code word?"

# game/ch15.rpy:272
translate english ch15_R4a_9bf3d434:

    # n "电话那头的妈妈一愣，随即笑出了声，报出了只有全家知道的那句话——这才是真妈妈。"
    n "Mom on the other end was stunned for a second, then burst out laughing and gave the phrase only the whole family knew — this was the real Mom."

# game/ch15.rpy:273
translate english ch15_R4a_68108fa1:

    # mom serious "「胡萝卜炖狐狸」！儿子，妈妈在外面办事，手机一刻没离身，什么警察都没联系过我！那些全是假的，一个字都不能给！"
    mom serious "\"Carrot-stewed fox\"! Sweetie, I'm out running errands and my phone hasn't left my hands for a second. No police ever contacted me! It's all fake — don't give them a single word!"

# game/ch15.rpy:274
translate english ch15_R4a_a75c6b5f:

    # n "阿狐立刻挂断、拉黑了所有可疑来电，卸载了可疑软件，把完整经过连同证据交给了真老师和警察，并做了报警备案。由于备案及时，警方第一时间冻结了骗子的收款渠道。"
    n "Ahu immediately hung up and blocked every suspicious number, uninstalled the suspicious software, and handed the full story with all evidence to his real teacher and the police, filing a report. Thanks to the timely report, the police froze the scammer's payment channels right away."

# game/ch15.rpy:285
translate english ch15_R4b_34e6eb96:

    # n "阿狐盯着那个「妈妈」的头像，心跳如鼓。他想起了早饭桌上的那句话，情急之下，对着语音喊了出来。"
    n "Ahu stared at the \"Mom\" avatar, heart pounding like a drum. The words from the breakfast table flashed back to him, and in his panic he shouted into the voice call:"

# game/ch15.rpy:286
translate english ch15_R4b_0032d449:

    # mc worried "妈，咱家暗号是不是「胡萝卜炖」——"
    mc worried "Mom, is our code word \"Carrot-stewed\"—"

# game/ch15.rpy:287
translate english ch15_R4b_3f7bff94:

    # n "话音未落，他就后悔了。"
    n "Before the words finished, he already regretted them."

# game/ch15.rpy:288
translate english ch15_R4b_6ff22687:

    # mom serious "暗号？都什么时候了还耍宝！快把验证码报给叔叔，妈妈求你了！"
    mom serious "Code word? What a time to play games! Hurry up and read the verification code to the officer — Mom's begging you!"

# game/ch15.rpy:289
translate english ch15_R4b_1c27d8bb:

    # think worried "不对……真妈妈听到暗号，应该笑着补上「狐狸」才对。她答非所问，只是一个劲地催验证码。"
    think worried "Wrong... hearing the code word, the real mom should laugh and add \"fox\". She dodged the question and just kept pushing for the code."

# game/ch15.rpy:290
translate english ch15_R4b_28f6f76d:

    # n "而且，暗号的半句，已经对着这个「可疑的门口」喊了出去。阿狐咬了咬牙，挂断语音，直接拨通妈妈的真实手机号。"
    n "What's more, half the code word had already been shouted at this \"suspicious door\". Ahu gritted his teeth, cut the voice call, and dialed Mom's real cell number directly."

# game/ch15.rpy:291
translate english ch15_R4b_416b492c:

    # mom serious "「胡萝卜炖狐狸」！儿子，妈妈手机一刻没离身，什么警察都没联系过我！那些全是假的，一个字都不能给！"
    mom serious "\"Carrot-stewed fox\"! Sweetie, my phone hasn't left my hands for a second. No police ever contacted me! It's all fake — don't give them a single word!"

# game/ch15.rpy:292
translate english ch15_R4b_46b791a3:

    # n "阿狐长出一口气，挂断、拉黑了所有可疑来电，卸载可疑软件，把完整经过连同证据交给了真老师和警察。由于备案及时，警方第一时间冻结了骗子的收款渠道。"
    n "Ahu let out a long breath, hung up and blocked every suspicious number, uninstalled the suspicious software, and handed the full story with all evidence to his real teacher and the police. Thanks to the timely report, the police froze the scammer's payment channels right away."

# game/ch15.rpy:293
translate english ch15_R4b_aed03a64:

    # police serious "记住：暗号是你手里的钥匙，只能开你自己拨出去的那扇门。对着可疑的门喊钥匙，等于把钥匙递给门外的人。"
    police serious "Remember: the code word is a key in your hand — it only opens the door you dial yourself. Shouting your key at a suspicious door is the same as handing it to whoever stands outside."

# game/ch15.rpy:304
translate english ch15_end3_8d1609f6:

    # n "当天晚上，爸爸妈妈提前回了家。餐桌上，阿狐把这一天的完整经过，一五一十讲给全家听。"
    n "That evening, Mom and Dad came home early. At the dinner table, Ahu walked the whole family through everything that had happened, from beginning to end."

# game/ch15.rpy:305
translate english ch15_end3_224f0a00:

    # n "讲到「王老师」的视频，妈妈倒吸一口凉气；讲到假「妈妈」的语音，爸爸放下了筷子。"
    n "At the \"Mr. Wang\" video, Mom gasped; at the fake \"Mom\" voice message, Dad set down his chopsticks."

# game/ch15.rpy:306
translate english ch15_end3_b527e301:

    # dad serious "连声音都能造，连脸都能造……这一年的反诈教育，今天才算真正结业。"
    dad serious "They can fake voices now, and faces too... After today, our year of anti-fraud education has truly graduated."

# game/ch15.rpy:307
translate english ch15_end3_ca94cb3a:

    # n "更漂亮的是，阿狐在自我保护之外，还多做了一步：他把「王老师」的账号和全部话术截图发给真老师，请老师在班级群发出预警。"
    n "Better still, Ahu did one more thing beyond protecting himself: he sent the \"Mr. Wang\" account and every screenshot of the script to his real teacher, asking her to post a warning in the class group."

# game/ch15.rpy:308
translate english ch15_end3_2c5e284f:

    # n "预警发出时，小兔正准备向「王老师」交200元「资料费」——看到预警，他把刚输了一半的密码删掉了。"
    n "By the time the warning went out, Xiaotu was just about to pay the 200-yuan \"materials fee\" to \"Mr. Wang\" — seeing the alert, he deleted the half-typed password."

# game/ch15.rpy:309
translate english ch15_end3_80ec170d:

    # rabbit worried "阿狐！要不是你发预警，我就转过去了！那可是我下周的早饭钱！"
    rabbit worried "Ahu! If it weren't for your warning, I'd have transferred it! That's my lunch money for next week!"

# game/ch15.rpy:310
translate english ch15_end3_9eab1c70:

    # mc laugh "记住了，先核实，再行动。"
    mc laugh "Remembered: verify first, act second."

# game/ch15.rpy:311
translate english ch15_end3_77222671:

    # n "当晚，真王老师在班级群发了长文提醒；警方顺着阿狐提供的账号与收款线索，串并出三起同类案件，隔壁班两个被骗的同学追回了损失。"
    n "That night, the real Mr. Wang posted a long reminder in the class group; following the account and payment leads Ahu provided, the police linked three similar cases, and two students from the neighboring class who had been scammed got their money back."

# game/ch15.rpy:312
translate english ch15_end3_2e8d894d:

    # police laugh "满分通关！来路不明的渠道，一个都没用；关键时刻，是「停一停」和「家庭暗号」救了场。记住这条终极心法：骗子能伪造一切，唯独伪造不了你自己拨出去的那通电话！"
    police laugh "Perfect score! Not one channel of unknown origin was used; at the critical moment, \"stop and think\" and the \"family code word\" broke the whole scheme. Remember this ultimate rule: a scammer can forge everything — except the call you dial from your own phone book!"

# game/ch15.rpy:313
translate english ch15_end3_83ecd9db:

    # mom laugh "还有最后一句——反诈小卫士，也不能自满哦。"
    mom laugh "One last thing — even an Anti-Fraud Guardian mustn't get cocky."

# game/ch15.rpy:314
translate english ch15_end3_b76fc744:

    # police laugh "对了！这套骗局之所以「精准」，是因为骗子从泄露的数据里拼出了阿狐的档案，又专门为「有经验的人」设计了剧本。越是老手，越要把自己当成第一次遇到骗局的新手！"
    police laugh "Right! The reason this scam was so \"precise\" is that the fraudsters assembled Ahu's dossier from leaked data and scripted it specially for \"experienced people\". The more of a veteran you are, the more you must face every scam like it's your first!"

# game/ch15.rpy:326
translate english ch15_end2_80b86ebb:

    # n "当晚，阿狐把这一天的经过，原原本本告诉了爸爸妈妈，并向警方做了完整备案。"
    n "That evening, Ahu told Mom and Dad everything exactly as it happened, and filed a complete report with the police."

# game/ch15.rpy:328
translate english ch15_end2_5e8dcf64:

    # n "点开礼包链接的代价很快就到账：游戏账号被异地强制登录，皮肤和点券被洗劫一空。虽然申诉找回了账号，里面的家当却早已搬空。"
    n "The price of tapping the gift-pack link arrived quickly: his game account was force-logged-in from somewhere far away, and his skins and vouchers were looted clean. He got the account back through an appeal — but the possessions inside were long gone."

# game/ch15.rpy:329
translate english ch15_end2_9aa97ae1:

    # mc sad "一个验证码，把我的账号整个送了人……"
    mc sad "One verification code, and my whole account was handed over..."

# game/ch15.rpy:331
translate english ch15_end2_45337d9e:

    # n "转给「王老师」的那200元，被层层拆进了十几个陌生账户，最终没能追回。"
    n "The 200 yuan sent to \"Mr. Wang\" was split layer by layer into a dozen strange accounts, and in the end could not be recovered."

# game/ch15.rpy:332
translate english ch15_end2_d5763a15:

    # mc sad "名单、红章、视频，样样都「齐全」，可钱一出手，样样都成了道具……"
    mc sad "The list, the red seal, the video — every \"proof\" was complete. Yet the moment the money left my hands, it all turned out to be props..."

# game/ch15.rpy:334
translate english ch15_end2_8d7328d8:

    # n "虽然没有实际损失，但阿狐心里清楚：从把截图发进群里、被「假呼应」带着走，或是把宝贵的时间耗在「再看看」「再听听」上——主动权早就悄悄滑向了对面。侥幸没出事，只是因为骗局还没来得及收网。"
    n "Although nothing was actually lost, Ahu knew perfectly well: from being swept along by the \"fake echoes\" in the group, to burning precious time on \"wait and see\" and \"let me hear him out\" — the initiative had long since slid to the other side. Escaping by luck only meant the scam hadn't gotten around to closing its net yet."

# game/ch15.rpy:335
translate english ch15_end2_78180856:

    # n "因为报案及时，家里的存款安然无恙；班级群里，真老师的预警也让同学们躲过了后续的骗局。"
    n "Because the report was filed promptly, the family's savings were untouched; and in the class group, the real teacher's warning kept his classmates out of the scam's later stages."

# game/ch15.rpy:336
translate english ch15_end2_01fb8467:

    # police serious "整体打得不错，但中途失了分：反诈没有「前面随便点、后面我机灵」——前面贪的每一步、拖的每一秒，都是在给最后一环埋雷。每一步都要干净，每一环都要警惕！"
    police serious "Solid work overall, but points were lost along the way: there's no such thing as \"be careless early, be clever late\" in anti-fraud — every step of greed and every second of hesitation early on is a landmine buried for the final round. Keep every step clean and every link sharp!"

# game/ch15.rpy:337
translate english ch15_end2_67544a81:

    # mom serious "记住今天的每一分侥幸，它下次未必还会眷顾你。"
    mom serious "Remember every stroke of luck today — it may not favor you next time."

# game/ch15.rpy:349
translate english ch15_end1_a20a89cc:

    # n "当晚，阿狐把这一天的经过，断断续续讲给了爸爸妈妈听，声音越说越小。"
    n "That evening, Ahu told Mom and Dad about the day, bit by bit, his voice shrinking smaller and smaller."

# game/ch15.rpy:351
translate english ch15_end1_ca914496:

    # n "最险的一幕出在晚上：骗子通过共享屏幕，实时看到了他银行账户的动账短信，正尝试转走卡里的钱。幸亏阿狐报警及时，警方紧急冻结，才保住了大部分存款——但仍有一笔800元没能拦下。"
    n "The most dangerous scene came at night: through the shared screen, the scammer saw his bank's transaction alert in real time and was trying to drain the card. Because Ahu reported it fast, the police froze the account in time and saved most of the money — but one transfer of 800 yuan couldn't be stopped."

# game/ch15.rpy:352
translate english ch15_end1_f24105e8:

    # mc sad "我以为自己稳操胜券，其实是把自己的口袋，一件一件翻开给骗子看……"
    mc sad "I thought I had everything under control — really I was turning out my own pockets for the scammer, one by one..."

# game/ch15.rpy:354
translate english ch15_end1_674c1d75:

    # n "游戏账号也没能幸免：骗子用「礼包页面」骗到的账号密码登录进去，动作比阿狐本人还熟练，皮肤和点券一夜清零。"
    n "The game account didn't escape either: with the account and password phished from the \"gift pack page\", the scammer logged in more smoothly than Ahu himself, and the skins and vouchers were wiped out overnight."

# game/ch15.rpy:356
translate english ch15_end1_6ed0fcab:

    # n "那笔200元「资料费」，连同幻想中的跑腿费，一起进了骗子的口袋。"
    n "That 200-yuan \"materials fee\", along with the fantasy errand fee, went straight into the scammer's pocket."

# game/ch15.rpy:358
translate english ch15_end1_fece5024:

    # n "从回复「王老师」、险些被假呼应牵着走，到对「李警官」的恐吓将信将疑——每一步他都踩在陷阱边上，全靠最后一刻的清醒才没有跌下去。"
    n "From replying to \"Mr. Wang\" and nearly being swept along by the fake echoes, to half-believing \"Officer Li's\" threats — every step landed on the edge of a trap, and only a last-moment clear head kept him from falling in."

# game/ch15.rpy:359
translate english ch15_end1_e48b5cf2:

    # n "妈妈没有责备，只是让阿狐把这次的每一条聊天记录，重新看了一遍。"
    n "Mom didn't scold. She simply had Ahu reread every single message from that day."

# game/ch15.rpy:360
translate english ch15_end1_6cbc8957:

    # mom serious "看看这些话术，哪一句不是冲着你心里最软、最怕、最得意的那个点去的？骗局研究过的从来不是你的账户，而是你的心。"
    mom serious "Look at these scripts — isn't every line aimed at the softest, most frightened, most flattering spot in your heart? What the scam studied was never your account. It was your heart."

# game/ch15.rpy:361
translate english ch15_end1_81323119:

    # police serious "最后一关你守住了，值得肯定！但请记住：反诈没有「及格线」，环环失守，步步惊心。从第一步开始就要干净——不点、不信、不拖、不共享，拿不准就用自己的号码问到底！"
    police serious "You held the final gate — that deserves credit! But remember: anti-fraud has no \"passing grade\". When every link gives way, every step is perilous. Stay clean from the very first step — don't tap, don't trust, don't stall, don't share your screen — and when unsure, question it to the end on numbers you dialed yourself!"

# game/ch15.rpy:373
translate english ch15_R4fail_76ed2331:

    # n "「妈妈」的声音成了压垮理智的最后一根稻草。阿狐把手机收到的验证码，一条条报给了「李警官」。"
    n "The voice of \"Mom\" became the last straw that crushed his reason. Ahu read out the verification codes from his phone to \"Officer Li\", one by one."

# game/ch15.rpy:374
translate english ch15_R4fail_95a9a4e0:

    # n "几分钟后，妈妈手机接连弹出扣款短信：银行卡被转走36000元，支付余额清零。"
    n "A few minutes later, deduction alerts popped up on Mom's phone one after another: 36,000 yuan transferred out of the bank card; the payment balance wiped to zero."

# game/ch15.rpy:376
translate english ch15_R4fail_21138f82:

    # n "因为屏幕还共享着，骗子甚至不用问——每一条验证码，他们都看得一清二楚。"
    n "With the screen still shared, the scammers didn't even need to ask — they could see every verification code crystal clear."

# game/ch15.rpy:377
translate english ch15_R4fail_9265af18:

    # n "紧接着，游戏账号被顶下线——皮肤、点券被洗劫一空；交给「王老师」的钱，自然也是有去无回。"
    n "Moments later, the game account was kicked offline — skins and vouchers looted clean; the money given to \"Mr. Wang\", naturally, was gone for good."

# game/ch15.rpy:378
translate english ch15_R4fail_af36f639:

    # n "最可怕的是：晚上，阿狐的游戏账号给全班同学群发了消息——「我是阿狐，家里出急事，借我200，明天还」，骗子正冒用他的身份，骗他的朋友。"
    n "Worst of all: that evening, Ahu's game account mass-messaged the whole class — \"It's Ahu. Family emergency, lend me 200, I'll pay you back tomorrow\" — the scammer was using his identity to scam his friends."

# game/ch15.rpy:379
translate english ch15_R4fail_399c10e8:

    # n "小兔差点就转了钱，还好多留了个心眼，先给阿狐妈妈打了电话。"
    n "Xiaotu nearly transferred the money, and only doubled back to call Ahu's mom first, sparing himself."

# game/ch15.rpy:380
translate english ch15_R4fail_e6dca6a6:

    # mc sad "我不仅害了全家……还差点害了同学……"
    mc sad "I didn't just sink my whole family... I nearly sank my classmates too..."

# game/ch15.rpy:381
translate english ch15_R4fail_9f7d6171:

    # n "妈妈回家后，阿狐哭着交代了一切。妈妈报警、冻结账户、在班级群发出预警，所幸同学们都看到了提醒，没有第二个家庭被骗。"
    n "After Mom came home, Ahu confessed everything through tears. Mom reported to the police, froze the accounts, and posted a warning in the class group — luckily everyone saw the alert, and no second family was scammed."

# game/ch15.rpy:382
translate english ch15_R4fail_0a4c89d7:

    # mom normal "钱可以再赚。你要记住：骗局最狡猾的地方，就是让受骗的人，变成骗局的一部分。"
    mom normal "Money can be earned again. But remember: a scam's cleverest trick is turning its victim into part of the scam."

# game/ch15.rpy:385
translate english ch15_R4fail_a0e15b2f:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！终极试炼的连环局：假老师骗信任、假视频做「铁证」、假警察造恐慌、假亲声做「背书」，最后用验证码收网。破解它只需要四句话：免费不点、转账必核、验证码不给、拿不准就用自己的号码找家人和警察。守住这四句，谁也骗不了你！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! The final trial's chain: a fake teacher to win trust, a fake video as \"hard proof\", a fake officer to spark panic, a fake family voice to \"vouch\" — then the code is how they close the net. Breaking it takes just four lines: don't tap freebies, verify every transfer, never give codes, and when unsure, reach family and police on numbers you saved yourself. Hold these four, and no one can ever fool you!"

translate english strings:

    # game/ch15.rpy:18
    old "王老师"
    new "Mr. Wang"

    # game/ch15.rpy:60
    old "自己不转账，把聊天截图发到班级群，问问其他同学收到没有"
    new "I won't transfer, but I'll post the screenshots in the class group and ask if anyone else got this"

    # game/ch15.rpy:62
    old "信息越「准」越要警惕——先放一边，用自己存的号码打给真老师核实"
    new "The more \"accurate\" the info, the warier I get — set it aside, call the real teacher on my own saved number"

    # game/ch15.rpy:65
    old "期中名次都说对了，肯定是真的——先领礼包，再交资料费"
    new "He got my midterm rank right, so it must be real — claim the pack, then pay the fee"

    # game/ch15.rpy:124
    old "不转账也不撕破脸，先拖住：「我考虑一下，4点半前答复您」"
    new "No transfer, no falling-out — stall for time: \"Let me think it over, I'll answer by 4:30\""

    # game/ch15.rpy:126
    old "音容笑貌都对得上，视频总不会有假——把200元资料费转过去"
    new "Face and voice both check out — a video can't be faked. Transfer the 200-yuan fee"

    # game/ch15.rpy:129
    old "脸可以造假，记忆造不了假——请「老师」讲讲上次班会上的小事"
    new "Faces can be faked, memories can't — make \"teacher\" tell me small things from the last class meeting"

    # game/ch15.rpy:186
    old "APP不敢装，电话也不敢挂——先听听他到底想干什么"
    new "Too scared to install the app, too scared to hang up — first hear what he really wants"

    # game/ch15.rpy:188
    old "真警察不会电话办案，更不会让你装APP——挂断，自己拨110，并告诉妈妈"
    new "Real police don't take cases by phone, let alone make you install apps — hang up, dial 110 myself, and tell Mom"

    # game/ch15.rpy:191
    old "配合调查要紧——下载「安全防护」APP，按指示开启屏幕共享"
    new "Cooperating with the investigation matters most — download the \"Safety Guard\" app and enable screen sharing as instructed"

    # game/ch15.rpy:194
    old "明知是骗局，将计就计——照他说的装APP取证，看这局怎么收场"
    new "I know it's a scam — I'll play along: install the app, gather evidence, and watch how this scheme ends"

    # game/ch15.rpy:256
    old "全部挂断！拨妈妈的手机号，先对家庭暗号再说"
    new "Hang up on everything! Call Mom's real number and check the family code word first"

    # game/ch15.rpy:259
    old "对着语音问暗号试试——情急之下，把暗号的半句喊了出来"
    new "Try asking the voice for the code word — in the panic, I blurt out half of it"

    # game/ch15.rpy:261
    old "「妈妈」都说结案了——把短信验证码报给「李警官」"
    new "Even \"Mom\" says the case is closed — read the verification codes to \"Officer Li\""

